@anon.152f57749fcdf0a673d809c4f4545e7f.688 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [469 x i8] }> <{ [469 x i8] c"Links to a URL or a location in the document.\0A\0ABy default, links are not styled any different from normal text. However,\0Ayou can easily apply a style of your choice with a show rule.\0A\0A# Example\0A```example\0A#show link: underline\0A\0Ahttps://example.com \\\0A\0A#link(\22https://example.com\22) \\\0A#link(\22https://example.com\22)[\0A  See example.com\0A]\0A```\0A\0A# Syntax\0AThis function also has dedicated syntax: Text that starts with `http://` or\0A`https://` is automatically turned into a link." }>, align 1
